# Root-level pointer. Module 01 has a single frontend env file: apps/web/.env.example
# Copy it to apps/web/.env.local. Later modules add backend, database and chain variables here.
#
# NEVER place private keys, seed phrases or API secrets in any committed file.

# Module 8A (server-side AI configuration) has its own file: apps/api/.env.example
# Copy it to apps/api/.env. Its variables never start with VITE_ and never reach the browser.
